They contain material from other sources, which keeps its own licence and
must keep its credit:

- Leipzig Corpora Collection, spa_news_2011_1M (CC BY 4.0): word frequencies
  and a few example sentences. D. Goldhahn, T. Eckart, U. Quasthoff: Building
  Large Monolingual Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection, LREC 2012.
  See es/frequency.source.json.
- Tatoeba, https://tatoeba.org (CC BY 2.0 FR): example sentences, each recorded
  with its Tatoeba id and contributor. See es/examples.source.json.

Every built book carries these credits on its "Fuentes" page.
